# Rules And Skills Index Maintenance

Use this rule when adding, renaming, deleting, or materially changing rules or skills.

Required index updates:
- `09_cursor/rules/INDEX.md` for `.cursor/rules/`
- `09_cursor/routing/task_mainlines.md` when routing or first-authority behavior changes
- `09_cursor/skills/INDEX.md` for `09_cursor/skills/` or `.cursor/skills/`
- `09_cursor/core/PROJECT_ADAPTER.md` when local truth surfaces or promotion boundaries change

Do not leave old rule names, old manual invocation handles, or stale numbering in docs.

After changes, search for old filenames and invocation handles.
